    { "type": "text", "id": "final_caption", "x": 60, "y": 575, "width": 850, "height": 60,
      "text": "Same idea as the Payments overview: every mechanism downstream -- the geohash\nencoding, the 9-cell fetch, the two churn-split stores -- exists to keep\n\"scan the whole planet\" from ever being the answer.",
